Regression: when the uplink is down at start time (no default route in
ubus status), pbr.start_service emits warningUplinkDown and returns
null on purpose — procd's boot trigger retries later. service_started
must NOT emit "FAILED TO START" or "Check the output of nft -c -f" in
that path, because nothing actually failed; we're deferring to boot mode.

